          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cpzEz",
          "name": "Spec Notes",
          "fill": "#475569",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "MODEL — An account holds MULTIPLE goals; each goal has its own saved amount, target & deadline.  ⚠ DB note: financial_goals is one-per-account today → impl needs many-per-account.\nREQ 1 (entry-aware create) — From Account: Akun pre-filled & locked to that account.  From Home: empty 'Pilih akun' picker (the variant shown).\nREQ 3 (save) — 'Buat Target' → Save success screen → land back on the account with the new goal card.\nREQ 4 (account cards) — Account page shows a 'Target Tabungan' section listing N compact goal cards (reusable component) + '+ Tambah'.",
